  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I'm a new very hard working world creator for VRChat and consistently been uploading a  very high quality world every week for the last 9 weeks, but the current labs limit of 1 world a week has hindered my rate of work, 1 isn't enough for a serious content creator or even a normal user, I even mistakenly uploaded a world i didnt want to but then was out of luck for a week since you can only upload 1 and theres no way to reset it even when i asked support.\nI highly suggest they increase it to 2, since that adds room for at least 1 mistake or at least make it so if youre a trusted user, you get 2 worlds that can be uploaded a week to labs.\ni currently have 5 fully fleshed out worlds that i can put out and they will get published fast since they are high quality, but at the labs current state, it'd take a month for them to come out, but i of course will be making even more worlds in that time, so im pretty hindered by that cap of 1 world a week, i want to keep bringing amazing worlds out, i hope they make this simple change.\n- Mista_Roy",
